  "invariants": [
    "LeeWay Standards remain constitutional authority above Runtime Fabric",
    "Runtime Fabric routes by existing contract/provider registries; Pocket does not embed ecosystem runtimes",
    "adapter translates but does not become authority",
    "availability is not authorization",
    "execution is not verification",
    "mounted != executed",
    "configured != proven",
    "source authority != runtime execution",
    "local eligibility gate != canonical Formula execution",
    "Android/system TTS is not Agent Lee Voice One",
    "Notebook Chrome extension is not an Android capability"
